   "kind": "prose",
   "text": "Before 1898 these documents state Cuba's importance as proximity plus trade: a rich island next door whose wars cost American commerce and whose ownership by a European power was an irritant. The thread runs from Hamilton Fish's instruction of 1874 through the despatches of 1897 to the President's war message of April 1898, which names both commerce and peace as stakes."
